{"title": "Potion of Angelic Relief (Condition)", "pageid": 26995, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Relief_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"POT Potion of Angelic Reprieve Unfaded Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Potion of Angelic Relief</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity falls asleep for 2 rounds. When it wakes up, it receives the effects of a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a> and all 1st and 2nd level spell slots are restored.</li>\n<li>If interrupted before the duration expires, the effects will not apply. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unconscious\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unconscious_(status_group)\" title=\"Unconscious (status group)\">Unconscious</a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SLEEP</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSLEEP%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSLEEP%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Unconscious\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Unconscious\">SG_Unconscious</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Condition\" title=\"SG Condition\">SG_Condition</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Sleeping\" title=\"SG Sleeping\">SG_Sleeping</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/OverheadOnTurn\" title=\"Status properties/OverheadOnTurn\">OverheadOnTurn</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>Despite the item being called \"Potion of Angelic Reprieve\", this condition is actually called \"Potion of Angelic Relief\" in-game.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Potion_of_Angelic_Relief\">Sources of Potion of Angelic Relief</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Reprieve\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Reprieve\">Potion of Angelic Reprieve</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>SLEEP</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Potion_of_Angelic_Relief\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Relief_(Condition)\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Relief (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Angelic Relief\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Reprieve_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Potion of Angelic Relief</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity falls asleep for 2 rounds. When it wakes up, it receives the effects of a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a> and all 1st and 2nd level spell slots are restored.</li>\n<li>If interrupted before the duration expires, the effects will not apply.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber (Condition)\">Potion of Angelic Slumber</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity falls asleep for 2 rounds. When it wakes up, it receives the effects of a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. If interrupted before the duration expires, the effects do not apply.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714222018\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2372/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32475/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8715/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.035/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1362530/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   60.066      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   60.066      1 -total\n 50.37%   30.258      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 30.10%   18.079      2 Template:Conditi